graph TD
    A[Calendar tab focus] --> B{Data loaded?}
    B -->|loading| L[Skeleton grid + 3 skeleton rows]
    B -->|error| E[Error card: 'Couldn't load' + Retry]
    E -->|Retry| A
    B -->|empty month| EM[Empty month card + 'Link account' CTA]
    B -->|has data| C[Summary Header: Spent so far / Still due / Income]

    C --> D[Month grid or week strip]
    D -->|tap day| F[Selected-day detail]

    F --> G{Day has events?}
    G -->|no| H[Empty day: 'Nothing scheduled']
    G -->|yes| I[Split chips: Received / Spent / Due]

    I --> J[ACTUAL group: solid rows]
    I --> K[UPCOMING group: dashed/ghosted projected rows]

    K -->|bill gets paid elsewhere| M[Bill disappears, becomes ACTUAL transaction]
    M --> J

    D -->|toggle expand| D
    C -->|prev/next month| A
    C -->|Today| A
